{
  "domainId": "HEALTHCARE_DOMAIN",
  "name": "H2. Physician workload and care-quality scorecard",
  "rawText": "# Do you know how effectively your physicians manage their workload and patient care?\n#  - Which physicians handle the highest number of completed visits?\n#  - How many unique patients does each physician serve?\n#  - How much time do physicians spend with patients on average?\n#  - Which physicians generate the highest total charges?\n#  - What percentage of laboratory results are abnormal for each physician\u0027s patients?\n#  - Which physicians manage high patient volumes while maintaining better laboratory outcomes?\n#  - How does physician workload and care quality compare across departments and clinic locations?\n#  - Are there physicians with no completed visits who may need further operational attention?\n# ____________________________________________________________\n\nDoctorLabs is LabResults:\n    Visit.DoctorId DoctorId,\n    Count(Id) LabCount,\n    CountIf(IsAbnormal = \u003Ctrue\u003E) AbnormalCount\n  Where Visit.Status = \u003CCompleted\u003E\n\nPhysicianScorecard is Doctors:\n  Left Join DoctorLabs On Id = DoctorLabs.DoctorId\n    FirstName \u002B \u003C \u003E \u002B LastName Physician,\n    Department.Name Department,\n    Location.City ClinicCity,\n    Examinations.CountIf(Status = \u003CCompleted\u003E) VisitCount,\n    Examinations.CountDistinctIf(UserId, Status = \u003CCompleted\u003E) PatientCount,\n    Examinations.AvgIf(DurationMinutes, Status = \u003CCompleted\u003E) AverageVisitMinutes,\n    Examinations.SumIf(Charge, Status = \u003CCompleted\u003E) Charges,\n    (\u003C100\u003E * DoctorLabs.AbnormalCount\n        / NullIf(DoctorLabs.LabCount, \u003C0\u003E)).Round(\u003C2\u003E) AbnormalLabPercent\n  Where Department.Name In \u003CPrimary Care, Specialty Care, Emergency Medicine\u003E\n  Order VisitCount DESC, Charges DESC\n  Take 10",
  "id": "Health 2. Physician workload and care-quality scorecard",
  "isBuiltin": false,
